# The Expert two-stream route of Colossus Hall in co-op, the visor Colossus (designer DB3; P1|P2, keys L R U D F K S;
# recorded from closed-loop duo macros with a hurt-driven repair search, build/db3/bot_w4_l2b_coop.gd). P2 walks over
# the axe on the floor, P1 jumps for the one hanging three rows up; both drop into the hall. The hero nearer to the
# plate whose chain glows holds it (the visor lifts) and hops the rocks spat at him; the other throws high axes from
# the rock ledge and steps out from under the ceiling drops. Every rage moves the live chain, so the roles swap
# (P1 holds first, then P2, ...). 16 hits (wf10 boss balance: the co-op form's hit points 24 x 2/3; fight 45-90 s),
# no hit taken; then a trophy (the Way Home follows). Never S; nobody stands 243 ticks without input.
# Re-recorded in wf10 (bosses) with the same bot and its repair search (build/bosses10/col4.log).
